        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 55D2002/18, Modern Series 18\" Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern 18 Inch Towel Bar was designed with the contemporary aesthetic in mind. The clean lines and modern, rectangular mounts emphasize its very on trend feel. This Modern Series 18 Inch Towel Bar is available in nice finishes. The actual bar of this bath towel holder is 16-3/8 inches long, which is big enough for two hand towels. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-55D2002-18-specifications.gif?v=1704354770\" width=\"600\" height=\"243\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 55D2002/18 18\" Towel Bar Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-24-inch-towel-bar-deltana-55d2003-24\"><b>24\" 55D Series Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"/products/24-inch-double-towel-bar-deltana-55d2006\"><b>24\" 55D Series Double Towel Bar</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nShop more of the <a href=\"/search?type=product&q=Deltana 55D Modern Series\"><b>Deltana 55D Series Bathroom Accessories</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of the 18 Inch Bathroom Towel Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 19-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Length: 16-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bar Length Including Mount: 18-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance from Wall to the Bar: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Height: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-55D2002-18-specifications.pdf?v=1691095324\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 55D2002/18 18\" Towel Bar Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold Individually.</b> Package includes: 1 towel bar, mounting screw cover, and all necessary mounting screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>This is a Limited Series. <b>Limited Quantities Available</b></i>\r\n</p>",
