                "title": "Modern 18 Inch Towel Bar",
                "description": "The Modern 18 Inch Towel Bar was designed with the contemporary aesthetic in mind. The clean lines and modern, rectangular mounts emphasize its very on trend feel. This Modern Series 18 Inch Towel Bar is available in satin brass, polished nickel, satin nickel, and polished chrome finishes. The actual bar of this bath towel holder is 16-3/8 inches long, which is big enough for two hand towels.",
